# =====================================================================
# Evidence artefacts are NOT committed.
#
# EV-001 (.eml), EV-002 (.zip) and Invoice_Helper.dll all contain the
# EICAR test string. Committing them causes GitHub's scanning and any
# cloner's antivirus to flag or quarantine the repository.
#
# Everything here is regenerated by 07_Notes/build_case_evidence.sh,
# and the hashes in 03_Hashes/ prove what it produces.
# =====================================================================

